          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"the-gluon-propagator-at-one-loop\">The gluon propagator at one loop</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Generate the QCD contributions to the gluon two-point function,\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(g^* \\to g^*||)</marimo-tex>, and inspect a diagram and its symbolic expressions.\nThe external momentum is off shell.</span></span>"
