          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">The last expression includes the symmetry factor and closed-loop signs,\nwith the model couplings expressed through <code>UFO::G</code>. The global\n<code>color_factor</code> remains separate from this expression and the UV steps.\nThe native graph factor already includes the Grassmann minus for each\nclosed ghost loop; <code>diagram_weight</code> evaluates it without an extra sign.\nAll algebra functions are defined in the notebook cells above.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The cells below expand an expression copy, apply FeynKit's tensor reduction,\nand compute the integrated UV counterterm.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SdmI",
      "code_hash": "8200009cc623c80f939a9da28246c2f6",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"build-the-energy-denominators\">Build the energy denominators</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>build_cff()</code> constructs the Cross-Free Family representation of this\ndiagram. Its output is a normal Symbolica expression. This step constructs\nthe denominators; it does not evaluate the loop integral.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
